{"id":"FIG-fc89daeb72f3b5f5","src":"figure","doc":"AUTOSAR_CP_SWS_TimeSyncOverFlexRay","page":68,"text":"«module» | FrIf | «module» | StbM | «module» | FrTSyn | get FrIf_GetMacrotickDuration() and FrIf_GetCycleLength() during initialization | Minimize delay, between sampling Flexray Global Time and the Virtual Local Time:  Prevent interruption between FrIf_GetGlobalTime() and StbM_GetCurrentVirtualLocalTime(). | StbM_GetCurrentVirtualLocalTime (StbM_SynchronizedTimeBaseType, | StbM_VirtualLocalTimeType* ) | FrTSyn_RxIndication(SYNC) | [FrIf_StatePtr == FRIF_STATE_ONLINE]: | *localTimePtr = T1vlt; *timeStampPtr = T1 | FrIf_GetState(Std_ReturnType, uint8, FrIf_StateType**) | T1 = T0 + (CycleLength * currentCycle) + (MacrotickDuration * currentMacroticks) | currentCycle = *FrIf_CyclePtr; currentMacroticks = *FrIf_MacroTickPtr | T0 | FrIf_GetGlobalTime(Std_ReturnType, uint8, uint8**, uint16**) | StbM_BusSetGlobalTime(StbM_SynchronizedTimeBaseType, const StbM_TimeStampType*, const StbM_UserDataType*, const StbM_MeasurementType*, const StbM_VirtualLocalTimeType* ) | T1 = T1 – (CycleLength * 64) | [currentCycle >= FCNT]: | FrTSyn_MainFunction() | T1vlt =*localTimePtr","caption":"Figure 5: FlexRay Time Synchronization (Time Slave)","sha":"fc89daeb72f3b5f575c431aa5234b17486ece6682e696d730d0718c963df3c3c","series":[{"id":"FIG-fc89daeb72f3b5f5","releases":["R18-10_R4.4.0_R1.5.0"],"sha":"fc89daeb72f3b5f575c431aa5234b17486ece6682e696d730d0718c963df3c3c"},{"id":"FIG-eb4dd1a7214a7922","releases":["R19-11"],"sha":"eb4dd1a7214a7922308e86e1e63b8546e6436ec89c2303838fe47704f226a573"},{"id":"FIG-166f5b7ba5e04e50","releases":["R20-11"],"sha":"166f5b7ba5e04e50028de37f8e4eaf1ccc0dd03be63ee0aa2e48624d8f7cb94b"},{"id":"FIG-88c4c9c467cdef65","releases":["R21-11"],"sha":"88c4c9c467cdef65dedd1c653473fdc5a29f075e49632c3f886c4fe38a3bd56d","caption":"Figure 9.2: FlexRay Time Synchronization (Time Slave)"},{"id":"FIG-267239b4c690e18d","releases":["R22-11"],"sha":"267239b4c690e18d137039f71ef33bd99